OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers flock to rebuild burnt
OL,4,Aout animal sanctuary
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver 30 volunteers have offered their
OL,7,Fhelp to an animal sanctuary in Surrey
OL,8,Fafter a barn burnt down, killing three
OL,9,Fbirds.
OL,11,FOrchard Farm Animal Sanctuary in
OL,12,FFarnham has received over #18,000 worth
OL,13,Fof donations since the fire on 5
OL,14,FNovember.
OL,16,FOn Saturday, volunteers were at the
OL,17,Fsite to clear the burnt down barn,
OL,18,Fready for the sanctuary to build its
OL,19,Fanimals a new home.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
