OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers flock to rebuild burnt
OL,4,Aout animal sanctuary
OL,5,
OL,6,FJenn Hamid, a volunteer at Orchard Farm
OL,7,FAnimal Sanctuary, said it was "really
OL,8,Fquite remarkable" that the fire service
OL,9,Fmanaged to save all the animals except
OL,10,Fthe three birds.
